<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-sp-800-53/EXAMINE> linkml:description "Review, inspect, observe, study or analyze specifications, mechanisms or activities." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-sp-800-53/HIGH> linkml:description "The baseline for a high-impact system." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-sp-800-53/INTERVIEW> linkml:description "Hold discussions with individuals or groups." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-sp-800-53/LOW> linkml:description "The baseline for a low-impact system." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-sp-800-53/MODERATE> linkml:description "The baseline for a moderate-impact system." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-sp-800-53/ONE> linkml:description "Exactly one choice, which the catalog leaves unwritten." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-sp-800-53/ONE_OR_MORE> linkml:description "One or more choices, which the publication writes as Selection (one or more)." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-sp-800-53/ORGANIZATION> linkml:description "The organization implements it, through its processes and people." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-sp-800-53/PRIVACY> linkml:description "The privacy baseline, which applies regardless of impact level." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/nist-sp-800-53/SYSTEM> linkml:description "The system implements it, through its mechanisms." .
