	linkml:description "A security or privacy control: a safeguard with an identifier, a statement of what it requires, a discussion, parameters the organization defines, related controls, references, the assessment objective and methods SP 800-53A gives it, and its enhancements. A control Revision 5 withdrew keeps its identifier and says where it went." ;
